Solutions to all three questions of the <University of Oxford> Part A <quantum theory> paper, sat on 22 June 2023. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/bsc_mathematics_part_a_examinati/response/2820674/attach/3/FOI%20202410%20944%20Data.pdf#page=153[original released PDF, bundle pages 153–156; paper pages 1–4]. Question statements are omitted. The symbol $\hbar$ denotes the <reduced Planck constant>.

